<title>USA: American White Cross Inc Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>American White Cross Inc Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						    First Quarter Ended</p>
<p>						  4/6/97	     3/31/96</p>
<p> Sales					  $20,408	   $22,559</p>
<p> Gross profit				   3,838	     4,379</p>
<p> Other income				     (4)		 (2)</p>
<p>Loss before reorganization items and</p>
<p>    benefit from income taxes	   (1,337)	   (1,198)</p>
<p>Reorganization items:</p>
<p>    Professional fees			 (435)		   -</p>
<p>Loss before benefit from income taxes</p>
<p>						  (1,772)	   (1,198)</p>
<p> Benefit from income taxes			-		 437</p>
<p> Net loss				     (1,772)	     (761)</p>
<p> Net loss per share			  (0.27)	    (0.11)</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding   6,676	     6,676</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it filed a petition for Chapter 11 reorganization on July 17, 1996, and currently operates as debtor-in-possession.</p>
<p>The company said its operating loss per share was $0.08 compared vs loss $0.11.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
